{"thread":{"threadID":3143,"boardID":13,"topic":"[Rankig] VinceG's Streberapfel Ranking. Hast du einen verdient?!","time":1447094999,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","lastPostTime":1447099377,"lastPoster":"Campelele","replies":6,"views":551,"attachments":1,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":40286,"threadID":3143,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"[Rankig] VinceG's Streberapfel Ranking. Hast du einen verdient?!","time":1447094999,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[{"attachmentID":693,"objectID":40286,"filename":"VincegStreberapfel.png","filesize":771747,"fileType":"image/png","isImage":1,"width":1000,"height":974,"downloads":130,"uploadTime":1447094506}],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong>Grüße Jungs und Mädels,</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>ich so als Streber habe natürlich immer Äpfel für Lehrer und eventuel für den ein oder anderen Schüler um mich einzuschleimen.</strong><br><strong>Schreib hier in den Thread wieso du einen Streberapfel verdient hast und ich gebe dir vielleicht einen.</strong><br><strong>Ein Streberapfel ist wie das Deutsche Sportabzeichen oder das Eiserne Kreuz. Es ist ein Prestige-Objekt zum Angeben.</strong><br><br><strong>Wer hat wieviele Streberäpfel?</strong><br><strong><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1791-pixel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Pixel</a> hat 1 Streberapfel.</strong><br><strong><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1788-zeschterer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Zeschterer</a> hat 1 Streberapfel.</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1791-pixel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Pixel</a> aka Malte erhält für hervoragende Leistung im Bereich Serveradministration einen Streberapfel. Gesegnet sei er mit Ehre und Rum.<br>Dream-Community, 09.11.2015. Bundeskanzlerin <em>Angela &#x27;<strong>AsylLover</strong>&#x27; Merkel</em> i.V. <em>Vincent &#x27;<strong>Streber</strong>&#x27; G.</em></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1788-zeschterer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Zeschterer</a> erhält für hervoragende Leistung im Bereich Zescht seiens einen Streberapfel. Gesegnet sei er mit Ehre und Rum.<br>Dream-Community, 09.11.2015. Bundeskanzlerin <em>Angela &#x27;<strong>AsylLover</strong>&#x27; Merkel</em> i.V. <em>Vincent &#x27;<strong>Streber</strong>&#x27; G.</em></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40288,"threadID":3143,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1447095202,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1447098354,"value":-1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1447099948,"value":-1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1447160203,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich verdiene einen weil ich einen Gottkomplex habe. Knie vor mir nieder, deinem Herrn und Schöpfer!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40289,"threadID":3143,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1447095422,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1486649850,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sehr geehrter Herr <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/54-craxto/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Craxto</a>,<br>ihr Antrag auf einen Streberapfel wurde Aufgrund von nicht erfühlten Vorraussetzungen abgelehnt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mit freundlichem Gruß,<br>Bundeskanzlerin <em>Angela &#x27;<strong>AsylLover</strong>&#x27; Merkel</em> i.V. <em>Vincent &#x27;<strong>Streber</strong>&#x27; G.</em></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40290,"threadID":3143,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1447095489,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1447098360,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Du wagst es deinem Herrn und Schöpfer einen Streberapfel zu verweigern? Das wird die 10 Plagen auf dich rufen!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40292,"threadID":3143,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1447096125,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1447096465,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1447160181,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Juhuu! &quot;Ehre und Rum&quot;!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40294,"threadID":3143,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1447096476,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Danke Zescht, dass du es wenigstens gecheckt hast. xDD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40297,"threadID":3143,"userID":1789,"username":"Campelele","subject":"","time":1447099377,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1447102515,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bezweifle, das man den Apfel essen kann, geschweige den ihn essen will.</p>","polls":[]}]}